# The palette folders are generated copies of src/; a finding there is the same
# finding eight times over, and build_themes.py --check is what holds them to
# their source. Atelier itself stays in scope: its sheets are those same copies,
# so they add no findings, and its _palette.css is the one file the build writes
# from scratch rather than copies -- the only generated CSS these rules would
# otherwise never see.
Atelier-*/

# Mirrors are generated too, and FreshRSS's own pipeline ignores them as well.
*.rtl.css

node_modules/
